## Interface: 16001
## Title: |cff9b8cffMello|rUI Oldschool
## Notes: MelloUI's painted look, the hand-painted reskin: the game's windows on painted stone and parchment, the painted frames, bars, borders and minimap. Its settings are on MelloUI's Oldschool page (/mello); untick it here to not load it at all.
